sonic-nixos: a changed BGP_NEIGHBOR local_asn / local_as_no_prepend /
local_as_replace_as of an existing peer is applied live ("neighbor X local-as ..."
or "no neighbor X local-as"); new peers get it from the template (patch 0004).
Upstream update_peer handles only admin_status. On top of 0003.
Applies to src/sonic-bgpcfgd.

--- a/bgpcfgd/managers_bgp.py
+++ b/bgpcfgd/managers_bgp.py
